{"segments":[{"n":1,"voix":"elle","debut":0,"fin":2.8,"texte":"Il est minuit… et il m'écrit encore."},{"n":2,"voix":"lui","debut":2.8,"fin":4.5600000000000005,"texte":"Mille kilomètres entre nous…"},{"n":3,"voix":"elle","debut":4.5600000000000005,"fin":6.16,"texte":"Mais une seule bulle."},{"n":4,"voix":"lui","debut":6.16,"fin":7.04,"texte":"FouLove."},{"n":5,"voix":"elle","debut":7.04,"fin":12,"texte":"Ici, il n'y a que nous deux. Nos mots doux, nos photos, nos vocaux…"},{"n":6,"voix":"lui","debut":12,"fin":14.64,"texte":"Nos instants, qui s'effacent après vingt-quatre heures."},{"n":7,"voix":"elle","debut":14.64,"fin":17.200000000000003,"texte":"Et tous nos souvenirs, rangés tout seuls."},{"n":8,"voix":"lui","debut":17.200000000000003,"fin":21.040000000000003,"texte":"J'ai même scellé une lettre. Tu ne pourras l'ouvrir que le jour de nos quatre ans."},{"n":9,"voix":"elle","debut":21.040000000000003,"fin":23.040000000000003,"texte":"Tu me fais languir !"},{"n":10,"voix":"lui","debut":23.040000000000003,"fin":27.12,"texte":"Pour t'inviter, un simple message. Nos téléphones se sont reconnus tout seuls."},{"n":11,"voix":"elle","debut":27.12,"fin":29.200000000000003,"texte":"Et tout est chiffré de bout en bout."},{"n":12,"voix":"lui","debut":29.200000000000003,"fin":30.96,"texte":"Personne ne peut lire ce qu'on se dit."},{"n":13,"voix":"elle","debut":30.96,"fin":32.480000000000004,"texte":"Pas même FouLove."},{"n":14,"voix":"lui","debut":32.480000000000004,"fin":33.440000000000005,"texte":"Une bulle…"},{"n":15,"voix":"elle","debut":33.440000000000005,"fin":34.56,"texte":"…à deux."}],"chars":["[","w","h","i","s","p","e","r","s","]"," ","I","l"," ","e","s","t"," ","m","i","n","u","i","t","…"," ","e","t"," ","i","l"," ","m","'","é","c","r","i","t"," ","e","n","c","o","r","e",".","[","s","o","f","t","l","y","]"," ","M","i","l","l","e"," ","k","i","l","o","m","è","t","r","e","s"," ","e","n","t","r","e"," ","n","o","u","s","…","[","s","m","i","l","i","n","g","]"," ","M","a",